      "reasons": [
        "The packet does not explicitly define “neural axis” as a “connected nerve network” or as a “functional pathway” in general; it only discusses assessing activity “throughout the cardiac neural axis.”",
        "The definition’s general framing (“across which neuronal activity can be assessed”) is only partially supported by the statement about “simultaneous assessment of neuronal activity throughout the cardiac neural axis,” without describing a pathway/connection structure in definitional terms.",
        "The definition’s specific characterization as “linked neural components involved in controlling heart rate” is only indirectly supported: the packet refers to modeling “individual components of the vagal sympathetic complex” and “in the control of heart rate,” but does not explicitly state that these are “the linked neural components” constituting the cardiac neural axis."
